[IQ Generator Preset]
# Lesson 10: ADC resolution and DC offset.
# Four bits per component and a small DC offset on top of 30 dB AWGN. The DC offset shifts the whole constellation and adds a line at 0 Hz in the Spectrum tab; the quantization error adds to the AWGN, so the clusters are wider than at 30 dB alone. Try ADC bits of 3, 6 and 10 to see where quantization stops mattering next to the noise. Use the Constellation tab with the matched-filter view.
